+        "The command uses the Ruby environment created in **Setup**. If you installed `ascli` another way, set `USE_NOTEBOOK_RVM=False`. The setup pins [ascli 4.28.0](https://github.com/IBM/aspera-cli/releases/tag/v4.28.0), which includes fixes for receiving lists of files through public package links.\n",
